### =========================================
### FASE 3: PRUEBAS DE PRODUCTOS
### =========================================

### 1. [CUSTOMER] Ver el menú disponible (Público)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/menu
Accept: application/json

### 2. [ADMIN] Ver todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TU_TOKEN_AQUI>

### 3. [ADMIN] Crear un producto nuevo
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TU_TOKEN_AQUI>

{
  "name": "Montadito de Jamón",
  "description": "Jamón ibérico con aceite",
  "price": 2.50,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "imageUrl": "https://ejemplo.com/jamon.png"
}

### 4. [ADMIN] Ver productos sin stock
GET http://localhost:8080/products/out-of-stock
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <TU_TOKEN_AQUI>